<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτνω</span></b> , poet. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίπτω</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>O.</u>
			2.23
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>P.</u>
			8.93
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νίκας ἐν ἀγκώνεσσι πίτνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>N.</u>
					5.42
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>I.</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1056
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1128
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, al.: impf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπιτνον</span>, poet. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίτνον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				16.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1732
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτνῶ</span></b> 
			is given as pres. by Gramm., as Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.290
			</span></i>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πιτνεῖς</span> is found in
			codd. of <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				77
			</span></i>; but cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.827
			</span></i>; forms with -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>- from -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εο</span>- are not found (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπιτνοῦμεν</span>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1754
			</span></i>, is unmetrical).</div>
